# env.optional — enrichment, storage, channels, CMS; the playbook runs without these.
# Additional AEO answer engines (each gates only its own engine):
OPENAI_API_KEY
GEMINI_API_KEY
TAVILY_API_KEY
# Measured volume / authority / BACKLINK data. Consumed by the sub-skills' bundled
# scripts/paid_seo.py (DataForSEO, HTTP Basic auth) during their optional enrichment step;
# the measured numbers propagate up into this playbook. Absent -> SERP-derived directional
# signals (sub-skill adapters exit gracefully, the keyless flow continues; backlinks
# unavailable). Semrush/Ahrefs/Keyword-Analysis are alternative providers (not implemented):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
KEYWORD_ANALYSIS_API_KEY
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_TOKEN
# Performance-tracking history (absent -> one-pass only, no longitudinal monitoring):
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_KEY
# Auto-publish + digests (absent -> produce drafts + write digest to workspace):
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL
# Hostile-site crawl fallback for the audit:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
